{"3141340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bananitro", "steam_appid": 3141340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras/dc98e8e0f5ab53bcb9d1384af5a5beda.poster.avif?t=1737635374\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras/dc98e8e0f5ab53bcb9d1384af5a5beda.webm?t=1737635374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras/dc98e8e0f5ab53bcb9d1384af5a5beda.mp4?t=1737635374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bananitro </strong>is a 2D runner game that combines speed and action with a unique gravity mechanic. Winner of the &quot;Monkey Jam 2024,&quot; <strong>Bananitro </strong>innovatively brings together monkeys and bicycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN TO WIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling Monkey on his bicycle, use <strong>Bananitro </strong>to reach incredible speeds, ride on walls, perform maneuvers, and make spectacular jumps that defy the laws of gravity. But be careful, each track is unique and full of obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH YOUR CREATIVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t be afraid to race in your own style. Whether fast and cautious, speedy and daring, or completely improvised, in <strong>Bananitro</strong>, creativity is the key to finishing the races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras/2e7c31ae0fad1d6f10b1d31097af7ebc.avif?t=1737635374\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras_big/2e7c31ae0fad1d6f10b1d31097af7ebc.avif?t=1737635374 width=800 height=777 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras/dc98e8e0f5ab53bcb9d1384af5a5beda.poster.avif?t=1737635374\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras/dc98e8e0f5ab53bcb9d1384af5a5beda.webm?t=1737635374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras/dc98e8e0f5ab53bcb9d1384af5a5beda.mp4?t=1737635374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bananitro </strong>is a 2D runner game that combines speed and action with a unique gravity mechanic. Winner of the &quot;Monkey Jam 2024,&quot; <strong>Bananitro </strong>innovatively brings together monkeys and bicycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN TO WIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling Monkey on his bicycle, use <strong>Bananitro </strong>to reach incredible speeds, ride on walls, perform maneuvers, and make spectacular jumps that defy the laws of gravity. But be careful, each track is unique and full of obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH YOUR CREATIVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t be afraid to race in your own style. Whether fast and cautious, speedy and daring, or completely improvised, in <strong>Bananitro</strong>, creativity is the key to finishing the races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras/2e7c31ae0fad1d6f10b1d31097af7ebc.avif?t=1737635374\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/extras_big/2e7c31ae0fad1d6f10b1d31097af7ebc.avif?t=1737635374 width=800 height=777 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Bananitro is a 2D game where you control Monkey on his bicycle, using Bananitro to perform maneuvers and conquer obstacle-filled tracks, with creativity as the key to success.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/header.jpg?t=1737635374", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/f42c3c99df4cb7a729fe369299fed1834abba59c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737635374", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141340/f42c3c99df4cb7a729fe369299fed1834abba59c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737635374", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 VRAM / DirectX 10+ support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 VRAM / DirectX 10+ support<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Inventario"], "publishers": ["Inventario"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 399, "final": 399, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$3.99"}, "packages": [1115221], "package_groups